/// The Reptile House from start to goal (any%), human-possible, in 3407 ticks.
/// Every stretch of buttons is held 3 ticks or more, and jump is pressed only after it was let
/// go. Of its 511 changes of buttons, each moved 1 or 2 ticks early or late, 501 live
/// through the second after, 493 through two seconds, and 389 through the whole
/// run with every later button as it was. Human-possible means each input has slack and a slip
/// is recoverable within a second, not that a person was tested on it.
